## List Requests

```
GET /requests
```

Returns all song requests with their status.

### Response

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "query": "Song name - Artist",
      "status": "pending",
      "metadata": null,
      "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

## Submit Request

```
POST /requests
```

Submit a new song request.

### Request Body

```json
{
  "query": "Song name - Artist name"
}
```

### Status Values

| Status | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `pending` | Request submitted, awaiting processing |
| `done` | Request fulfilled, track added |
| `rejected` | Request rejected |
